sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer / TPP
  participant E as WAF / API / BFF
  participant T as Transfer Service
  participant F as Real-Time Fraud
  participant G as CBS Gateway
  participant B as CBS
  participant O as Outbox / Event Bus
  C->>E: POST /v1/transfers + idempotency key
  E->>T: Verified identity / consent context
  T->>F: Evaluate canonical command
  alt Fraud decline
    F-->>T: DECLINE
    T-->>C: FRAUD_REJECTED
  else Fraud approve
    F-->>T: APPROVE
    T->>G: Canonical CBS command
    G->>B: Legacy CBS transaction
    B-->>G: COMMITTED or REJECTED
    G-->>T: Canonical result
    T->>O: Persist state and publish outcome
    T-->>C: Two-axis transfer status
  end

